5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm going to find the werewolf and get rid of them fast. Let's be direct and not waste time!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, young one. Let us listen to each other with open hearts to find the truth.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Servas. I hope we can all get along while we figure this out together.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll be watching how everyone reacts. Deception usually leaves a trail in the emotions.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Logic is the only reliable tool here. I will focus on inconsistencies in the statements.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, don't just watch. If you see something, say it immediately!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,It is often in the silence that the most important clues are hidden.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help everyone.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, rushing leads to mistakes. I'll speak when the evidence is clear.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Toshio. We need a baseline of behavior before we can identify anomalies.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, but we can't just sit around. We need a plan for tomorrow.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Servas,,A plan based on trust and mutual respect will serve us best.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Midori,,Maybe we can share our thoughts on who seems the most uneasy?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"That's a start, though ""unease"" is subjective.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Subjectivity is a weakness. We should track who supports whom and why.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I've got this. I'll lead the way to the win.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
