36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Listen up! I know who the werewolf is. It's Midori!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Servas,,"That is a very bold claim to make so early, Takumi. Are you certain?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Midori,,"What? Takumi, why would you say that? I thought we were friends!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Midori's reaction is quite emotional. It could be genuine shock or a calculated act.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, on what basis do you make this accusation? Provide your evidence.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm the Seer! I checked her last night and she's the werewolf!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Servas,,"If you are the Seer, then we have a clear path, but we must be sure.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Midori,,"This is a mistake! I'm just a villager! Please, don't believe him!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Toshio,,The Seer usually reveals themselves carefully. Takumi is being very aggressive.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"A Seer claim is a strong piece of evidence, but it can be faked by the werewolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not faking! @Ryuji, do you really think I'd lie to protect a werewolf?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Servas,,Let us look at Midori. Does her distress seem honest to you all?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'm just so sad that Takumi would point at me... I only want us to win!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Toshio,,Midori is appealing to our emotions. That is a common tactic for those hiding something.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If Takumi is the Seer, Midori is the wolf. If Midori is human, Takumi is lying.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Stop overthinking it! She's the wolf! Vote her out now!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Servas,,I trust the conviction in Takumi's voice. I will vote for Midori.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Midori,,"Please, I'm innocent! I can't believe this is happening!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The logic leans toward Takumi being the Seer given the timing. I'll vote Midori.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"While abrupt, the Seer's information is the most direct evidence available. I vote Midori.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
